## Completion checks

- [ ] Refine a home inside a broader neighborhood, lower visual detail and inspect the seam and preserved mounts. Cancel or undo and recover the earlier accepted region.

Use additive or replacement purposes independently for appearance and walkable support. Commit overlapping home and neighborhood revisions in both priority orders. At a coarse view, an accepted replacement must still cover the obsolete home.

